{"kind":"report","text":"Approved at exact head 99f12d856906400d5c648ae40d9561828e485e9e (tree c184d3ee5585034a71e6c9fb2063a47ed5bda9ef), the notes-only head that carries my approval a7a2d4be of c1452fd1 and the two Status edits the planner required (act 0c11a920). The group is XD-1 (draft revision fence), Counting (finite fulfillment pairs) and the Security cleanup, on published main 8a9f9d1e. The verdict binds the three implementation promises 2f7f1ef2, 4c2560ee and fce117c4, with reporting artifacts 755117e9, a0633b79 and 73159fa3, and signs all 15 path artifacts. The three lane conclusions below carry over from a7a2d4be, because only two Status lines change.\n\n## Evidence\n- **Delta.** `git diff --no-renames c1452fd1 99f12d85` changes four lines in two files under `notes/`: the Status of `notes/2026-11-13-scope-client.md` and the Status of `notes/2026-11-21-property-based-testing.md`. No source, test, document or other note byte changes, so every source and test byte equals the full-gate head a779ade8.\n- **Artifacts.** The 15 filed artifacts equal the 15 changed paths against 8a9f9d1e: none missing, none extra, none twice. `gs review --prepare` binds all three lanes.\n- **Source gate.** END a7e42f58 on a779ade8 (tree 37e8a416) passed with exit 0 in 990.83 s: Node 246, Counting 60, Plain 5,089 with one skipped, Native 1,239 with two skipped, crossings 0 lost, 4 stale, 0 unowned. Its `gate.txt` (SHA-256 `4c7c6b88…`) matches.\n- **Notes-only gate.** `gate.txt` (SHA-256 `217d477e…`) names head 99f12d85, tree c184d3ee, changed files 0, records \"test skipped: only paths under notes/ changed\", and ends \"gate passed\", exit 0, 30.24 s. It matches END 290900b5.\n- **Checks.** The merge into origin/main (8a9f9d1e) is clean with tree c184d3ee. `check-commit-messages` flags none of 6 commits, `check-notes` reports 0 warnings, `git diff --check` is clean. The added lines carry no other project's name and no `/Users/` path. The 8 hashes in the implementation note matched